---@field RoleARN? aws.firehose.NonEmptyStringWithoutWhitespace The role that Firehose can use to access Amazon Web Services Glue. This role must be in the same account you use for Firehose. Cross-account roles aren't allowed.
---@field CatalogId? aws.firehose.NonEmptyStringWithoutWhitespace The ID of the Amazon Web Services Glue Data Catalog. If you don't supply this, the Amazon Web Services account ID is used by default.
